         measured: truth 0.1656: D 0.1656, L 0.1656; E 0.1699, E_rank 0.1735
         reading:  selecting on the model's own baryons is not free of the outcome when the carrier is most of the binding mass; only the Lagrangian estimator is exact in all three cases

